OL,3,GNEWSASepsis survivor feared she
OL,4,A'wouldn't make it'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was in agony, confused, and at times
OL,7,FI feared I wouldn't make it."
OL,9,FDianne Pole hopes to raise awareness of
OL,10,Fsepsis after her experiences following
OL,11,Fspinal surgery at Queen's Medical
OL,12,FCentre (QMC) in Nottingham in 2023.
OL,14,FThe 59-year-old said she spent almost
OL,15,Fthree months in hospital after
OL,16,Fdeveloping an infection and underwent
OL,17,Fseven operations to wash out and remove
OL,18,Fdying tissue from her surgical wound.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
