OL,3,GNEWSASepsis survivor feared she
OL,4,A'wouldn't make it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham University Hospitals NHS
OL,7,FTrust, which runs QMC, apologised for
OL,8,FPole's experience, adding it remained
OL,9,F"committed to listening to and engaging
OL,10,Fwith Dianne regarding her concerns".
